        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Siluwano na Timoteyo turabandikiye abo mw ishengero ry’i Tesalonike, bari mu Mana Data wa twese no mu Mwami Yesu Kristo: ubuntu bube muri mwebge n’amahoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
