            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko bose bīvugira ubgabo inkuru z’ingene twaje muri mwebge, kand’ ingene mwahindukiriye Imana, mugaheba ibigirwamana, ngo mukorere Imana nyakuri kandi nzima, ",
          "type": "text",
